## SECTION 4: STATE MACHINES

### Entity: Deliverable
- **Allowed Transitions:** 
  - Planned -> In Progress (Manual, Delivery)
  - In Progress -> Internal Review (Manual, Delivery)
  - Internal Review -> Client Review (Manual, PM)
  - Client Review -> Approved (Manual, Client)
  - Client Review -> Changes Requested (Manual, Client)
- **Forbidden Transitions:** Client Review -> Planned. Approved -> Changes Requested.
- **Automatic Transitions:** None.
- **Approval Rules:** Only Client Admin or designated Client Approver can approve.

